            "Dimension scores are calculated as the mean of their underlying normalised indicators (e.g., AR = (AR1+AR2+AR3)/3). Vulnerability is then the only solution entering with a minus sign —as a penalty, rather than as an additive good— which makes it a weighted sum composite:",
